msgid "NUT Based"
msgstr "Temeljeno na NUT-u"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Name you would like to give this UPS.  For APCUPSD and NUT Devices, a corresponding Cacti Device will be created automatically for the UPS using this name.  For SNMP based UPS's, you must create the Cacti Device first."
msgstr "Naziv koji želite dati ovom UPS-u. Za APCUPSD i NUT uređaje automatski će se stvoriti odgovarajući Cacti uređaj za UPS s ovim nazivom. Za UPS-ove temeljene na SNMP-u najprije morate stvoriti Cacti uređaj."

#: upses.php
msgid "New UPS"
msgstr "Novi UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Description"
msgstr "Opis UPS-a"

#: upses.php
msgid "A more detailed Description of this UPS if required."
msgstr "Detaljniji opis ovog UPS-a, ako je potreban."

#: upses.php
msgid "UPS Type"
msgstr "Vrsta UPS-a"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Type of UPS you are monitoring."
msgstr "Vrsta UPS-a koji nadzirete."

#: upses.php
msgid "Poller ID"
msgstr "ID pollera"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller that this UPS exists in is monitored by"
msgstr "Poller koji nadzire ovaj UPS"

#: upses.php
msgid "Site Name"
msgstr "Naziv sjedišta"

#: upses.php
msgid "The Site that this UPS exists in."
msgstr "Sjedište u kojem se ovaj UPS nalazi."

#: upses.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Ništa"

#: upses.php
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Lokacija"

#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Fizička lokacija uređaja. Ovaj tekst slobodnog oblika može biti soba, pozicija u ormaru itd."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Cacti uređaj"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Za UPS-ove temeljene na SNMP-u odaberite Cacti uređaj koji će se koristiti za SNMP vjerodajnice. U suprotnom odaberite Ništa, a UPS dodatak će automatski stvoriti uređaj za vas."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Automatski stvori pri prvom prikupljanju"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Omogućeno"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Označite za trenutačno pokretanje prikupljanja podataka."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "Podaci za APC UPSD"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Naziv glavnog računala na kojem se izvodi apcupsd ili NUT poslužitelj (upsd)."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "TCP port"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Unesite TCP port za ovaj UPS. Zadani port za apcupsd je 3551, a za NUT 3493."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Vrijeme isteka (sekunde)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Koliko dugo poller čeka na apcupsd ili NUT poslužitelj prije odustajanja od ovog UPS-a, od 1 do 120 sekundi. UPS-ovi temeljeni na SNMP-u umjesto toga koriste SNMP vrijeme isteka."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "NUT opcije"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "NUT naziv UPS-a"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Naziv UPS-a na NUT poslužitelju, kako ga navodi \"upsc -l\" (dio ispred @ u ups@host). Jedan NUT poslužitelj može posluživati više UPS-ova."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "NUT korisničko ime"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Opcionalno. Račun iz upsd.users za autentifikaciju. Ostavite prazno za anonimni pristup samo za čitanje, što je uobičajen način nadzora NUT poslužitelja."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "NUT lozinka"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Lozinka za NUT korisničko ime."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Koristi TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Šifrirajte vezu pomoću STARTTLS prije slanja bilo kakvih vjerodajnica. Certifikat i naziv glavnog računala NUT poslužitelja se provjeravaju, pa Cacti poller mora vjerovati certifikatu ili ispod možete navesti njegovu CA / datoteku certifikata."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "CA / datoteka certifikata"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Opcionalno. Puna putanja na Cacti polleru do PEM datoteke koja sadrži CA certifikat (ili samopotpisani certifikat poslužitelja) za provjeru NUT poslužitelja, na primjer /etc/nut/upsd.pem. Gore navedeni naziv glavnog računala mora odgovarati certifikatu."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Dopusti samopotpisani certifikat"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Prihvati bilo koji certifikat bez provjere. Veza je i dalje šifrirana, ali NUT poslužitelj nije autentificiran, pa bi napadač u sredini (man-in-the-middle) mogao pročitati NUT vjerodajnice. Preporučuje se korištenje gornje CA / datoteke certifikata."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "SNMP opcije"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Naziv glavnog računala na kojem se nalazi snmp agent."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "ID pollera ne može se promijeniti dok je UPS povezan s Cacti uređajem. Umjesto toga promijenite poller na uređaju."

#: upses.php
msgid "Template UPS was not found! Unable to duplicate."
msgstr "Predložak UPS-a nije pronađen! Nije moguće duplicirati."

#: upses.php
msgid "None of the selected UPSes has a Cacti Device yet, so Graph Automation was not run.  A device is created on the first successful poll."
msgstr "Nijedan od odabranih UPS-ova još nema Cacti uređaj, pa automatizacija grafova nije pokrenuta. Uređaj se stvara pri prvom uspješnom prikupljanju."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es).  %d UPS(es) have no Cacti Device yet and were skipped."
msgstr "Automatizacija grafova pokrenuta je za %d UPS uređaj(a). %d UPS uređaj(a) još nema Cacti uređaj i preskočeni su."

